1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,891
Every room at the Venetian Las Vegas has
its own sunken living room.

2
00:00:04,021 --> 00:00:07,591
Every room is a suite, from six hundred
fifty square feet.

3
00:00:07,721 --> 00:00:10,671
The resort says that is nearly double a
typical Strip room.

4
00:00:10,801 --> 00:00:14,092
Beds come with Egyptian cotton and a
pillow top.

5
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:17,529
Bathrooms have deep soaking tubs and a
glass shower.

6
00:00:17,659 --> 00:00:19,618
Some suites even have a pool table.

7
00:00:19,748 --> 00:00:21,266
Some look out at the Sphere.

8
00:00:21,396 --> 00:00:25,871
Guests rate it nine point four out of ten,
from nineteen thousand sixty-four reviews

9
00:00:25,901 --> 00:00:26,461
on Expedia.

10
00:00:26,591 --> 00:00:28,875
The full tour is on my channel.
